{"id":"zhangyan-m-c262c20525b1891bd43c","kind":"mention","text":"本篇原文记及何定，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["zhangyan-q-951503e821e592624f0c"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"luxun-q-o067","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-4e37980845bda5da36df","layer":"original","quote":"时何定弄权，阉官预政〖23〗。抗上疏曰：“臣闻开国承家，小人勿用；靖谮庸回〖24〗，唐书攸戒。是以雅人所以怨刺〖25〗，仲尼所以叹息也〖26〗。春秋以来，爰及秦、汉，倾覆之衅，未有不由斯者也。小人不明理道，所见既浅；虽使竭情尽节，犹不足任；况其奸心素笃，而憎爱移易哉？〖27〗苟患失之〖28〗，无所不至。今委以聪明之任，假以专制之威；而冀雍熙之声作〖29〗，肃清之化立：不可得也。方今现吏，殊才虽少〖30〗；然或冠冕之胄〖31〗，少渐道教〖32〗；或清苦自立，资能足用；自可随才授职，抑黜群小。然后俗化可清，庶政无秽也。”","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":311,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":261,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"panlu-q-17b05a1b0aca01a1b7ca","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-00c4a52a369a3c9708d0","layer":"original","quote":"时殿上列将何定佞巧便辟〖1〗，贵任事。凯面责定曰：“卿见前后事主不忠，倾乱国政，宁有得以寿终者邪〖2〗？何以专为佞邪，秽尘天听〖3〗？宜自改厉；不然，方见卿有不测之祸矣","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":126,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":84,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"panlu-q-8300958ebf19b8877ec3","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-12e8ded67588160e90de","layer":"original","quote":"皓常衔凯数犯颜忤旨〖15〗，加何定谮构非一〖16〗；既以重臣，难绳以法；又陆抗，时为大将在疆埸〖17〗：故以计容忍","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":132,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":2,"end":59,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"panlu-q-9fa3db9285d099f77c9c","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-868322f07629aeb01c40","layer":"original","quote":"凯陈：“何定不可任用！宜授外任，不宜委以国事","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":21,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"panlu-q-a520f05a9f933fa1ab0a","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-739b2e79b3f80b0076c9","layer":"original","quote":"定大恨凯，思中伤之。凯终不以为意，乃心公家，义形于色；表疏皆指事不饰〖4〗，忠恳内发","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":127,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":42,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-4558be81461365b4e08c","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-4a94fbfb17c35295d445","layer":"original","quote":"殿中列将何定曰〖6〗：“少府李勖枉杀冯斐〖7〗，擅撤军退还。”","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":397,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":12,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-9bf4aaade1c5ec91f410","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-a25fcdf12829999cf3bc","layer":"original","quote":"皓以其恶似张布，追改定名为“布”","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":426,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":35,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-bb3b3b64ece9ecf30f55","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-45d70d9264df03990201","layer":"original","quote":"秋九月，何定将兵五千人，上夏口猎","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":398,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-da187ff0ccf70e31ba4a","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-a25fcdf12829999cf3bc","layer":"original","quote":"何定奸秽发闻，伏诛","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":426,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":25,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-121edd72faccd3a905c0","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-79adb2c84bd62d3b6a9d","layer":"original","quote":"是岁，何定建议凿圣溪，以通江淮","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":330,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":15,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-63ce555739f3c93bef6a","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-79adb2c84bd62d3b6a9d","layer":"original","quote":"后定被诛","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":330,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":51,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-951503e821e592624f0c","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-79adb2c84bd62d3b6a9d","layer":"original","quote":"是岁，何定建议凿圣溪，以通江淮〖1〗。皓令莹督万人往，遂以多磐石，难施功，罢还。出为武昌左部督〖2〗。后定被诛，皓追圣溪事，下莹狱，徙广州〖3〗。","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":330,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-03eacb2be0d3764d8557","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-f65ba97b8a7bc23d2f78","layer":"original","quote":"晋以秀为骠骑将军，仪同三司，封会稽公","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":18,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-4a7e5567cb2d60bed41d","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-b23e76cc61a495cb2f8a","layer":"original","quote":"秀公室至亲〖3〗，握兵在外，皓意不能平。建衡二年，皓遣何定，将五千人，至夏口猎","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-63add2c2583dcdcf9975","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-b23e76cc61a495cb2f8a","layer":"original","quote":"先是，民间佥言秀当见图〖4〗；而定远猎〖5〗，秀遂惊：夜将妻子亲兵数百人奔晋","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":40,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-759a9d4b02f9ad90c7e8","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-8ddb0a1b1e0b7f157769","layer":"pei","quote":"吴平，降为伏波将军，开府如故。永宁中卒，追赠骠骑、开府","attribution":"裴注·晋诸公赞","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":171,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a894451a6ed9a28bec1c","start":121,"end":148,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-98aba9e9067377432321","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-8ddb0a1b1e0b7f157769","layer":"pei","quote":"秀在晋朝，初闻皓降，群臣毕贺；秀称疾不与，南向流涕曰：‘昔讨逆弱冠以一校尉创业，今后主举江南而弃之；宗庙、山陵，于此为墟：悠悠苍天，此何人哉！’朝廷美之","attribution":"裴注·干宝晋纪","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":171,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a894451a6ed9a28bec1c","start":34,"end":110,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-d394a19294806fa95bb7","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-8ddb0a1b1e0b7f157769","layer":"pei","quote":"皓大怒，追改秀姓曰‘厉’","attribution":"裴注·江表传","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":171,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a894451a6ed9a28bec1c","start":11,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
